  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Provision of services for supervision of a works contract for construction of the new Court in Novi Sad, in accordance with PRAG and with the Serbian Law for Planning and Construction; and provision of adequate technical assistance and advice to the Contracting Authority and to the Beneficiary during the project&apos;s implementation.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
